00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:08.920
It's not safe it's not okay.

00:09:08.920 --> 00:09:12.152
But it's the life I'm used to.

00:09:12.152 --> 00:09:12.990
- [Interviewer] How old are you?

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:13.823
- [Josh] I'm 25.

00:09:13.823 --> 00:09:14.656
- [Interviewer] 25.

00:09:14.656 --> 00:09:15.489
No kids?

00:09:15.489 --> 00:09:16.322
