00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:20.840
I've been using drugs since I was young

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:25.170
I was shooting up since I
was 18, heroin, PCP, crack.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:27.357
I've done it all, acid, you know.

00:09:28.203 --> 00:09:29.520
- [Interviewer] What do you worry about?

00:09:29.520 --> 00:09:30.353
- [Josh] What do I worry about?

00:09:30.353 --> 00:09:32.370
- [Interviewer] What do
you worry about, yeah.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:34.650
